  "description": "Offline authored normalization-png16 control; pending review and separate capture authorization. Capability-only requests precede exports. Pinned Substance OCIO configuration; default template, 256px public plane, User0 RGB32F, one visible Split fill, Normal opacity 1, neutral geometry, identity Nearest Repeat UV. Explicit enum GenericColorSpace.Raw must roundtrip exactly; Data/string aliases refuse. Color channel flag remains unobserved; format does not imply color management. Setup once; fresh getters in same_session and after Full save/reopen, no r2 setters. Template capture checks channels and resolution in each round. Resource identity must join the pinned import receipt through a versioned from_project query and exactly one retrieved resource in each round, with the owned CREATE UUID unchanged. Resource version identifies resource content, not the input file SHA256. Calibration uses f32(n/65535) and adjacent floats toward 0/1 in different RGB channels; endpoints stay 0/1. Cross-channel differences do not establish scalar readout collisions without independent channel-invariance evidence. Normalization uses complete RGB codes n,(n+21845)%65536,(n+43690)%65536, n=256*y+x. PNG16 and normalized FLOAT EXR compare observable transfer only. No identity-readout assumption, sRGB-float, decoder identification, fit, tolerance tuning or production promotion. All pixel inputs are public formulas, never selected from private differences.",
